Shelve the error state while constructing and growing the thread-cleanup registry.
Restore it on every exit so failed registration cannot acquire nested handlers.
Requires the master-key initialization check and bootstrap allocation fix.
Corresponds to report 07: thread-cleanup registration error re-entry.

--- a/crypto/initthread.c
+++ b/crypto/initthread.c
@@ -13,6 +13,7 @@
